    'IsCoatom in the lattice of TwoSidedIdeal means maximal proper two-sided ideal. The converse and uniqueness are both included. Nontrivial E is an explicit source repair, not hidden in the original target. Norm-closedness is proved separately using perturbation; no closed-ideal assumption is substituted for idealhood.'
