AddRecord 'lem:countable-blocks-lp-c0' @('PFP.Lemma_4_19','PFP.lemma_4_19','ThesisCommon.countableBlockIndexEquiv','ThesisCommon.lpBlockFlattenIsometry','ThesisCommon.cZeroBlockFlattenIsometry') 'complete' `
    'A nonempty countable sum of ellp(N,Y) is linearly isometric to ellp(N,Y) for finite 1<=p. The corresponding c0 assertion holds as well.' `
    'Finite nonempty blocks are included. An actual bijection Delta times N to N reindexes every coordinate. The lp proof equates the nonnegative sums defining membership and norm; the c0 proof equates finite level sets and suprema. Both surjective linear isometries and the full original target are proved, without an infinite-index assumption.'
AddRecord 'lem:cofinal-pigeon' @('PFP.Lemma_4_20','PFP.lemma_4_20','ThesisCommon.countable_union_cofinal_pigeonhole') 'complete' `
    'A countable cover of a set of cardinality kappa has a member of cardinality kappa when cf(kappa)>aleph0.' `
