AddRecord 'lema:block-diagonal-lp-c0' @('PFP.Lemma_4_26_asPrinted','PFP.lemma_4_26_asPrinted','PFP.Lemma_4_26','PFP.lemma_4_26_uncountable','PFP.LpLargeDiagonalBlocks','PFP.CZeroLargeDiagonalBlocks','ThesisCommon.countable_invariant_partition','ThesisCommon.lp_invariant_countable_blocks','ThesisCommon.cZero_invariant_countable_blocks') 'complete' `
    'For separable coefficients, each projection on a finite 1<p lp sum or c0 sum admits a countable-block partition with projection compressions and a full-cardinality noninteracting block family.' `
    'Both actual spaces are proved, including the unrestricted printed formula for finite, countable and empty index sets. Phase alignment and sublinear finite-sum growth give countable incoming fibres; separable images give outgoing countability. Closing under their symmetric union produces genuinely invariant countable blocks. Every pair of distinct blocks is separated, so H is the entire ordinal index set. No additional cardinality or cofinality assumption is needed.'
AddRecord 'lem:coordinate-diagonalisation' @('PFP.Lemma_4_27_asPrinted','PFP.Lemma_4_27','PFP.lemma_4_27_uncountable','PFP.generalCoordinateEntry','ThesisCommon.relation_free_set_of_locally_countable_either','ThesisCommon.UncountableSchauderSum.diagonal_coordinates_of_locally_countable_either') 'context-restored uncountable version complete; unrestricted printed formula not proved' `
    'There is a full-cardinality coordinate set with vanishing off-diagonal entries if both incidence sets are countable, or if the cardinal is above aleph1 and at each coordinate at least one incidence set is countable.' `
    'The proof retains the local choice at every coordinate. It first chooses a full-cardinality side of the partition by outgoing countability, restricts the relation to that actual subtype, and uses Hajnal there, transposing in the incoming case. For two-sided countability the full uncountable recursion applies. The section-context premise is explicit; the unrestricted printed formula is separately preserved and unproved, see PFP-S05.'
AddRecord 'lem:block-decomp1' @('PFP.Lemma_4_28','PFP.lemma_4_28','ThesisCommon.IsWeaklyCompactlyGenerated.ellOne_countable_outgoing_entries','ThesisCommon.IsWeaklyCompactlyGenerated.ellOne_diagonal_coordinates') 'complete' `
