AddRecord 'lem:block-decomp2' @('PFP.Lemma_4_29','PFP.lemma_4_29','ThesisCommon.UncountableSchauderSum.diagonal_coordinates_of_countable_total_dual') 'complete' `
    'For a symmetric non-ell1 sum above aleph1 and coefficients with a countable total dual set, each endomorphism has a full-cardinality set of pairwise vanishing off-diagonal entries.' `
