AddRecord 'cor:intro-C01' @('PFP.Corollary_4_7','ThesisCommon.continuousMapPrincipalL1Equiv','ThesisCommon.continuousMapComplexPrincipalL1Equiv','ThesisCommon.exists_intervalContinuousDual_measure_family','ThesisCommon.intervalContinuousRealDual_cardinal_le_continuum') 'partial infrastructure; original result unproved' `
    'The original claim is primariness of the actual dual of C[0,1] under anti-CH. Real and complex principal bands are represented by actual L1 spaces of their Riesz measures, and the full dual is isometric to an ell1 family of finite Borel-measure L1 spaces on the interval.' `
